Licensing
=========

This repository contains both original project material and modifications to
KDE Plasma Workspace files.

Original project material
-------------------------

Unless a file states otherwise, original scripts and documentation created for
this project are licensed under:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

The full license text is available at:

    LICENSES/GPL-2.0-or-later.txt

Patched KDE Plasma Workspace material
-------------------------------------

The patch in `patches/` modifies upstream KDE Plasma Workspace files. Those
files retain their respective upstream copyright notices and licensing terms.

Depending on the upstream file, the applicable SPDX identifier is:

    GPL-2.0-or-later

or:

    LGPL-2.0-or-later

See `docs/LICENSE-AUDIT.md` for the per-file audit and `LICENSES/` for the
included license texts.

Nothing in this repository is intended to relicense KDE's upstream code.

Project status
--------------

This is an independent, unofficial modification of KDE Plasma Workspace. It is
not an official KDE project and is not endorsed by KDE.
